{"id":"058c412328d32071","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-categoricity.md","title":"Categoricity","display":"df-categoricity — Categoricity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-categoricity","aliases":["58-df-categoricity","Categoricity"],"display":"df-categoricity — Categoricity","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-categoricity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-categoricity</span><span>Categoricity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-categoricity — Categoricity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,T,S_0\\in V\">\\(L,T,S_0\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq S_0\">\\(T\\subseteq S_0\\)</span> 是语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的句子理论</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)\\)</span>（模型谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\)</span>（结构论域，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\)</span>（完全参数化的结构同构谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Categorical}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Categorical}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本文件定义）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{L,\\kappa}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{L,\\kappa}(T)\\)</span> 是显式保留语言参数的兼容记号</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T,L)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|=|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)|=\\kappa)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T,L)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|=|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)|=\\kappa)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity\\text{-}compat} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cat}_{L,\\kappa}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity\\text{-}compat} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cat}_{L,\\kappa}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Categoricity: all models of a given cardinal uniquely determined up to isomorphism</li>\n<li>同构结论展开到上游四元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S\\)</span>，不再依赖未注册的自然语言缩写。</li>\n<li>Morley''s theorem: for a complete theory in a countable language, categoricity in one uncountable cardinal implies categoricity in every uncountable cardinal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>-categoricity is governed instead by the Ryll-Nardzewski theorem and does not by itself imply uncountable categoricity.</li>\n<li>Uncountable categoricity: Baldwin-Landkof-type rank; stability theory central</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Hodges, A Shorter Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ 且 $\\omega\\leq\\kappa$（see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)$（模型谓词，see [[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)$（结构论域，see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)$（完全参数化的结构同构谓词，see [[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,T,S_0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq S_0","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\leq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Categorical}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{L,\\kappa}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T,L)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|=|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)|=\\kappa)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categoricity\\text{-}compat} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cat}_{L,\\kappa}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false}],"bytes":2247,"backlinks":[{"id":"e591de700289dd8f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)$（see [[58-df-categoricity]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-categ